# Grok API shipping rule

When implementing Builder / Coding-agent remediation for Release Desk:

1. Keep or extend `apps/releasedesk/src/lib/grok-release-intel.ts`.
2. Expose via `POST /api/grok/release-intel`.
3. Return structured classify + extract + score + summarize.
4. `trustCheck.humanGateStillRequired` must stay `true`.
5. Without `XAI_API_KEY` / `GROK_API_KEY`, return MOCK-labeled fallback — never fake a live mode.
6. Do not auto-approve merge/release from Grok scores.
7. Preserve iteration gate + ATLAS/OWASP merge block behavior.
